@startuml
title Sequence Diagram — RTB Hot Path (AdScale)

actor "DSP Partner / User" as DSP
participant "DSP API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Ad Server" as AdServer
database "Redis (Hot Data)" as Redis
participant "Bidding Service" as Bidding
participant "Budget Service" as Budget
participant "Delivery Service" as Delivery
participant "Event Sink Service" as EventSink
queue "Kafka" as Kafka

DSP -> Gateway: POST /openrtb/v2.5/bid
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway: Auth & Rate Limit & Circuit Breaker
Gateway -> AdServer: HTTP/gRPC (normalized bid request)
activate AdServer

AdServer -> Redis: GET targeting & campaign data
activate Redis
Redis --> AdServer: campaign data
deactivate Redis

AdServer -> AdServer: Match ad candidates
AdServer -> Bidding: gRPC Evaluate(candidates)
activate Bidding

Bidding -> Redis: MGET bid_multipliers, floor_prices
activate Redis
Redis --> Bidding: bid configs
deactivate Redis

Bidding -> Budget: gRPC CheckBudget(campaign_ids)
activate Budget
Budget --> Bidding: available budgets
deactivate Budget

Bidding -> Bidding: Apply rules & select winner
Bidding --> AdServer: EvaluateResponse (winner)
deactivate Bidding

AdServer -> Delivery: gRPC Render(winner)
activate Delivery
Delivery -> Delivery: Generate HTML/JS
Delivery --> AdServer: RenderResponse
deactivate Delivery

AdServer --> Gateway: HTTP Response
deactivate AdServer

Gateway --> DSP: 200 OK (Bid Response)
deactivate Gateway

== Async Event Streaming ==
Delivery -[hidden]> EventSink: Async publish
Delivery -> EventSink: HTTP POST (impressions, clicks)
activate EventSink
EventSink -> Kafka: Publish ad.impressions / ad.clicks
deactivate EventSink
Bidding -> Kafka: Publish auction.win-loss

@enduml
